// ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//  English
//
//  Translated from zh-Hant.js. Rules (see i18n.js):
//    · Pure data — no functions, no template literals
//    · Placeholders are {name}; plurals are { one, other } and select on `n`
//    · Inline HTML is deliberate (say() takes HTML) — keep the tags exactly
//
//  Conventions used here:
//    · 空白樂譜 → "Blank Score" (the in-game item you paste MML into)
//    · 智能分弦 → "Smart voice split", 和弦全採 → "Full chord capture"
//    · Key signatures keep Western note names, matching the c/d/e in the MML
//    · Buttons and tags are kept short — the full wording lives in the tooltip
// ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

